note tour-new <name> <kind> [note] [--group g]: create an empty tour. The agent needs it to create the tour the agent contract requires every new non-trivial symbol to go into. kind is flow (what happens when X), layer (an abstraction's surface) or data (a data structure and what mutates it). The note and group are optional and set in the same command. Creating a name that exists changes nothing but the note and group given, so a script that creates its tours can be run again.

